<title>RUSSIA: TABLE-Russia July yr/yr inflation 14.7 vs 14.5 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Russia July yr/yr inflation 14.7 vs 14.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's year-on-year consumer price inflation rate was 14.7 percent in July after June's record low 14.5 percent, the first acceleration since June 1995, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES    JUL 97    JUN 97    JUL 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	 +0.9	+1.1	+0.7</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	  +14.7     +14.5     +43.6</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
